Without prior written permission from the copyright holder, and except for the third-party components described in section 3, you may not:
a. copy, reproduce, republish, re-upload or redistribute the Software or any part of it, including the APK file and the website's files, except for the copies made automatically when you install, run or visit it yourself;
b. modify, decompile, reverse engineer or take apart the Software, or make, publish or distribute anything based on it (a "derivative work"), including a renamed or rebranded version, except to the extent that the law where you live allows this despite this restriction (for example for security research or interoperability);
c. use the Software, or any part of it, for commercial purposes (for example selling it, charging for access to it, including it in a paid product or service, showing ads in or around it, or making money from it in any other way);
d. remove or change this license or any copyright notice;
e. use the name "Castlora" or the Castlora logo for another product or service.

3. Third-party components

The Software includes third-party components. Each is covered by its own license, listed under "Open-source licences and notices" on the website (https://william-lindberg.github.io/castlora/notices.html). Those licenses apply only to those components and give no rights to the rest of the Software. In particular:
a. Stockfish. The chess engine files engine/stockfish-19-lite-single.js and engine/stockfish-19-lite-single.wasm (on the website, and the same files inside the APK) are Stockfish.js 19, a separate program based on the Stockfish chess engine. They are licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3 (GPL v3), not under this license. Castlora uses them unmodified and communicates with them only through UCI text messages. Nothing in this license restricts your rights under the GPL for those files: you may copy, modify and redistribute them under the terms of the GPL. Their complete source code is available at https://github.com/nmrugg/stockfish.js/tree/v19.0.1 and https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish, and the text of the GPL is in engine/COPYING.txt (https://william-lindberg.github.io/castlora/engine/COPYING.txt).
b. Chess pieces. The chess piece artwork is the Cburnett set from Wikimedia Commons (authors Cburnett and Rfc1394, modified by shaack for cm-chessboard). It, and the board marker artwork by shaack, stay under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported license (CC BY-SA 3.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/).
c. Opening names. The opening names come from lichess-org/chess-openings and stay dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

