The website's files and the APK are hosted in a public GitHub repository (https://github.com/William-Lindberg/castlora). GitHub's Terms of Service let GitHub users view and fork public repositories on GitHub. That gives no rights beyond this license: you may not use, change, publish or distribute a fork or any of its files in any way this license does not allow.

